Operating Authority Minister for Defence. 

BAL DVOR unusuable in sector R150 to R170 below 5500ft AMSL outside 20NM due to terrain.
Due to rising terrain to the south of the facility,
Aircrew may observe BAL DME unlocks in sectors R150 - R175 and R195 - R205 below 4500ft AMSL and outside 20NM due to terrain.

This VOR is fitted with a voice facility which allows the pilot to receive ATC instructions in the event of an aircraft radio comms failure by turning the &quot;ident&quot; to volume on the VOR Rx box.</value></Data>
